flowchart TD
    %% sync_domain_with = scan_domain + apply_scan
    caller[sync_domain_with] --> snap[Read the stamp snapshot]
    snap --> scan
    subgraph scan [scan_domain: no store lock]
        walk[Walk the domain folder] --> stat[Stat each file]
        stat --> pre{mtime and size unchanged?}
        pre -->|yes| keep[Reuse the stamp]
        pre -->|no| hash[SHA-256 off-thread]
    end
    subgraph apply [apply_scan: one transaction]
        classify[Classify new, modified, deleted, moved] --> deletes[Apply deletes first]
        deletes --> slabs[Upsert in slabs]
        slabs --> refs[Resolve forward references]
    end
    hash --> classify
    keep --> classify
    refs --> commit[(Commit)]
